doctype html
html(lang="en")
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        meta(name="viewport", content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
        title About
        include ../components/Link/link.pug
    body 
        main.about-page(aria-labelledby="about-title")
            .about-container
                .about-content
                    h1.about-title#about-title What is this?
                    .about-description
                        p The designs in this file are a part of an open-source project to showcase some basic use cases or application flows that can be covered with tests.
                        p The file contains UI mocks for <strong>Web</strong> and <strong>Mobile</strong> app (iOS), which have slightly different flows.
                        p Main navigational components of both are on the <strong>Components</strong> page.
                        p Both flows are connected into <strong>prototypes</strong>, so check them out!
                    .about-actions(aria-label="Choose application flow")
                        a.about-button.button-web(href="./index.html") Web app
                        a.about-button.button-mobile(href="../mobile/catalog.html") Mobile app